      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits just east of the intersection of Missouri Route 123 and Route 215, about 11 miles southwest of Bolivar.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
